      "citation_reference": "NICE Clinical Guideline NG217, Section 1.3 (2022)",
      "chunk_content": "Advise patients in baseline stable state on general safety precautions, including taking showers instead of unmonitored baths, using protective equipment during cycling/sports, and identifying individual seizure triggers such as acute systemic illness, fever, emotional stress, or alcohol intake. Ensure annual structured clinical reviews.",
