      "chunk_content": "Stage N1 represents the vulnerable sleep-wake transition with elevated sensory arousal thresholds. Disproportionately elevated N1 percentage (>10-12% of total sleep time) is a primary hallmark of sleep fragmentation, frequent micro-arousals, or periodic limb movements. Ensure acoustic attenuation and evaluate for occult sleep-disordered breathing if N1 persists without rapid consolidation into N2.",
